{
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "tasks": [
    {
      "label": "Tamias: WASM 预览（WebGL + 几何服务）",
      "type": "shell",
      "command": "powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File \"${workspaceFolder}/scripts/wasm-preview.ps1\" -NoBrowser -WithGeometryServer",
      "options": {
        "cwd": "${workspaceFolder}"
      },
      "presentation": {
        "reveal": "always",
        "panel": "dedicated",
        "showReuseMessage": false,
        "clear": true
      },
      "problemMatcher": [],
      "detail": "按需配置并构建 tamias_viewer（WebGL 后端）→ 起 .NET 几何服务（:5199）→ 在独立窗口起预览服务（:3000）。调试 WebGL 一律连服务端一起起；关掉对应窗口即停止对应服务"
    },
    {
      "label": "Tamias: 结束调试进程",
      "type": "shell",
      "command": "powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File \"${workspaceFolder}/.vscode/predebug.ps1\"",
      "options": {
        "cwd": "${workspaceFolder}"
      },
      "presentation": {
        "reveal": "silent",
        "panel": "shared",
        "showReuseMessage": false,
        "close": true,
        "echo": false
      },
      "problemMatcher": [],
      "detail": "结束正在运行的调试构建，避免 Restart 时无法覆盖 tamias.exe"
    },
    {
      "label": "Tamias: 确保几何服务在跑",
      "type": "shell",
      "command": "powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File \"${workspaceFolder}/scripts/ensure-geometry-server.ps1\"",
      "options": {
        "cwd": "${workspaceFolder}"
      },
      "presentation": {
        "reveal": "silent",
        "panel": "shared",
        "showReuseMessage": false,
        "close": true,
        "echo": false
      },
      "problemMatcher": [],
      "detail": "只给 attach 当 preLaunchTask 用，不用手动跑：端口已经在听就直接返回（幂等，所以 F5 起过服务之后再 attach 是安全的），没在听就起一个独立窗口并等到端口通。它只起不编——产物缺失会明确报出来并指向下面的构建任务"
    },
    {
      "label": "Tamias: 构建几何服务",
      "type": "shell",
      "command": "powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -Command \"& '${workspaceFolder}/scripts/ensure-geometry-server.ps1' -Stop; if ($LASTEXITCODE -ne 0) { exit $LASTEXITCODE }; & '${workspaceFolder}/scripts/build-server.ps1' -WithShell -Offline\"",
      "options": {
        "cwd": "${workspaceFolder}"
      },
      "presentation": {
        "reveal": "always",
        "panel": "dedicated",
        "showReuseMessage": false
      },
      "problemMatcher": [],
      "detail": "先停服务再编：tamias_server.dll 被正在跑的 Tamias.Server 占着时重链必失败，所以命令里串了两步——ensure-geometry-server.ps1 -Stop（幂等，没在跑也算成功）→ build-server.ps1 -WithShell -Offline（编 tamias_server.dll 并把 .NET 壳 publish 到 build\\bin\\RelWithDebInfo）。不再单独占一条'停止几何服务'任务，因为它只服务这一条命令"
    },
    {
      "label": "Tamias: 检查桌面预设",
      "type": "shell",
      "command": "powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File \"${workspaceFolder}/scripts/check-desktop-preset.ps1\" \"${command:cmake.activeConfigurePresetName}\"",
      "options": {
        "cwd": "${workspaceFolder}"
      },
      "presentation": {
        "reveal": "silent",
        "panel": "shared",
        "showReuseMessage": false,
        "echo": false
      },
      "problemMatcher": [],
      "detail": "Configure preset 不是桌面树（msvc / linux）时给出明确提示，而不是 ninja 的 unknown target 'tamias'"
    },
    {
      "label": "Tamias: 编译",
      "dependsOn": ["Tamias: 结束调试进程", "Tamias: 检查桌面预设"],
      "dependsOrder": "sequence",
      "type": "cmake",
      "command": "build",
      "preset": "${command:cmake.activeBuildPresetName}",
      "targets": [
        "tamias"
      ],
      "group": {
        "kind": "build",
        "isDefault": true
      },
      "presentation": {
        "reveal": "silent",
        "panel": "shared",
        "close": true,
        "showReuseMessage": false
      },
      "problemMatcher": [],
      "detail": "调试前结束旧进程并编译最新的 tamias 目标"
    },
    {
      "label": "Tamias: 打包 MSI",
      "type": "cmake",
      "command": "build",
      "preset": "msi",
      "targets": ["tamias_msi"],
      "group": "build",
      "presentation": {
        "reveal": "always",
        "panel": "dedicated",
        "showReuseMessage": false
      },
      "problemMatcher": [],
      "detail": "用 Release 编译并生成 build/package/Tamias-*-win64.msi（日常调试请继续用 Debug）"
    }
  ]
}
